WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:05.671
Open Family from More. You can use the home on your own or enable private iCloud

00:05.671 --> 00:11.205
sharing. Review the explanation before uploading. Adding a member profile alone does

00:11.205 --> 00:12.325
not grant access.

00:15.400 --> 00:20.731
After enabling sharing, use the invitation controls and Apple sharing screen. The

00:20.731 --> 00:26.129
other person opens the invitation with their iCloud account. They should join your

00:26.129 --> 00:28.103
home, not create another copy.

00:30.400 --> 00:35.283
Review participants and access in the sharing controls. Both devices need

00:35.283 --> 00:40.969
connectivity for changes to sync, and updates can take time. Keep using local records

00:40.969 --> 00:43.110
when the network is unavailable.

00:45.400 --> 00:51.018
A saved iCloud backup is a separate snapshot, not the same as live family sync. Open

00:51.018 --> 00:56.436
Manage backups under Privacy and data to review backup and restore options before

00:56.436 --> 00:57.171
using them.
